---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ContactSection from '../components/ContactSection.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About Sebastian | Web Developer in Glasgow | Bastian Studio" description="Meet Sebastian, a Glasgow web developer who designs, builds and looks after every website personally. Plain English, fixed quotes." current="About">
<section id="top" class="hero-pad" style="position: relative; padding: 80px 0 96px; background: radial-gradient(900px 460px at 80% 0%, rgba(62,143,208,.22), transparent 70%), #0A1020">
  <div class="wrap split" style="align-items: center">
    <div class="split-a7">
      <p class="mono" style="margin: 0 0 20px; color: #9FD3F5"><a href="/" style="color: #9AA8BC; text-decoration: none">Home</a> / About</p>
      <h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: clamp(40px, 5.4vw, 76px); font-weight: 500; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -.045em">Passionate about technology. <span class="serif" style="color: #9FD3F5">Focused on your online success.</span></h1>
      <p style="margin: 28px 0 16px; font-size: clamp(18px, 1.6vw, 21px); line-height: 1.55; color: #DCE5F0; max-width: 52ch">Hi, I’m Sebastian, a Glasgow-based web developer with a lifelong passion for computers, technology and everything digital.</p>
      <p style="margin: 0 0 32px; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: #B7C3D4; max-width: 52ch">I’ve lived in Glasgow for over 12 years, so I know the local market and how important it is for businesses here to stand out online.</p>
      <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px">
        <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-ice">Let’s build something together
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 9h12M10 4l5 5-5 5"></path></svg>
        </a>
        <a href="tel:+447543673841" class="btn btn-ghost">Call 07543 673841</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="split-b5">
      <div role="img" aria-label="Photo of Sebastian (placeholder)" style="aspect-ratio: 4 / 5; max-width: 420px; margin-left: auto; border-radius: 28px; background: radial-gradient(420px 320px at 30% 20%, rgba(62,143,208,.35), transparent 70%), #14203D; border: 1px solid rgba(159,211,245,.2); display: flex; align-items: flex-end; padding: 24px; color: #9AA8BC; font-size: 14px">[Your photo: a friendly, natural shot works best]</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" style="padding: 104px 0; background: #0C1426; border-top: 1px solid rgba(159,211,245,.1)">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div class="split-a">
      <p class="mono" style="margin: 0 0 18px; color: #9FD3F5">My approach</p>
      <h2 class="h2">More than just <span class="serif" style="color: #9FD3F5">building websites.</span></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="split-b">
      <p class="lead" style="font-size: 19px; color: #C9D4E3; max-width: 60ch">A great website should do more than look good. It should represent your brand, build trust with customers and help your business grow.</p>
      <p class="lead" style="margin-top: 16px; max-width: 60ch">That’s why I bring together web design, SEO, digital marketing and new technology like AI, with a business-focused mindset on every project.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" style="padding: 104px 0">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="mono" style="margin: 0 0 18px; color: #9FD3F5">Why work with me</p>
    <h2 class="h2" style="margin-bottom: 40px">What you can <span class="serif" style="color: #9FD3F5">count on.</span></h2>
    <div class="why">
      <div class="why-item">
        <span style="display: flex; width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(159,211,245,.1); border: 1px solid rgba(159,211,245,.2); align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 18px">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#9FD3F5" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 12a4 4 0 1 0 0-8 4 4 0 0 0 0 8zM4 21c1.5-4 4.5-6 8-6s6.5 2 8 6"></path></svg>
        </span>
        <h3 style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 21px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -.02em">Personalised approach</h3>
        <p style="margin: 0; color: #9AA8BC; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55">No templates, no one-size-fits-all. Everything is planned around your business, customers and goals.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-item">
        <span style="display: flex; width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(159,211,245,.1); border: 1px solid rgba(159,211,245,.2); align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 18px">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#9FD3F5" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l2.5 5.5L20 11l-5.5 2.5L12 19l-2.5-5.5L4 11l5.5-2.5z"></path></svg>
        </span>
        <h3 style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 21px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -.02em">Exceptional visual design</h3>
        <p style="margin: 0; color: #9AA8BC; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55">Modern, polished design that makes your business look established and earns trust in seconds.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-item">
        <span style="display: flex; width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(159,211,245,.1); border: 1px solid rgba(159,211,245,.2); align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 18px">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#9FD3F5" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l7 3v6c0 4.5-3 7.5-7 9-4-1.5-7-4.5-7-9V6zM9 12l2 2 4-4"></path></svg>
        </span>
        <h3 style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 21px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -.02em">Built to a high standard</h3>
        <p style="margin: 0; color: #9AA8BC; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55">Fast, secure, mobile-first websites, tested on every device and built to last.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-item">
        <span style="display: flex; width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(159,211,245,.1); border: 1px solid rgba(159,211,245,.2); align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 18px">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#9FD3F5" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 4h7v7H4zM13 4h7v7h-7zM4 13h7v7H4zM13 13h7v7h-7z"></path></svg>
        </span>
        <h3 style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 21px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -.02em">Everything in one place</h3>
        <p style="margin: 0; color: #9AA8BC; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55">Website, SEO, Google Ads, branding and social graphics from one person who knows your business. No juggling suppliers.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-item">
        <span style="display: flex; width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(159,211,245,.1); border: 1px solid rgba(159,211,245,.2); align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 18px">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#9FD3F5" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21a9 9 0 1 0 0-18 9 9 0 0 0 0 18zM12 7v5l3 2"></path></svg>
        </span>
        <h3 style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 21px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -.02em">Convenience &amp; peace of mind</h3>
        <p style="margin: 0; color: #9AA8BC; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55">I handle hosting, updates, backups and fixes, so you can focus on running your business.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-item">
        <span style="display: flex; width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(159,211,245,.1); border: 1px solid rgba(159,211,245,.2); align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 18px">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#9FD3F5" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h16v11H9l-5 4z"></path></svg>
        </span>
        <h3 style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 21px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -.02em">Honest, direct communication</h3>
        <p style="margin: 0; color: #9AA8BC; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55">You talk to me, not an account manager. Plain English, fixed quotes, no surprises.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<ContactSection />

</BaseLayout>
